Workspace for Miscellaneous Bug Fixes



FormEditor Bug Fixes

Written by Adele Goldberg. This file-in fixes three minor FormEditor bugs.



"To file it in:"

(FileStream oldFileNamed: 'FormEditor-fixes.st') readOnly; fileIn.



Transcript Refresh Bug Fix

Packaged by Evelyn Van Orden. This file-in brings the Transcript to the top on the screen (in case it is overlapped by other views) so that messages can more readily be seen.



"To file it in:"

(FileStream oldFileNamed: 'Transcript-refresh-fix.st') readOnly; fileIn.



FileIn/FileOut User Feedback Improvements

Packaged by Evelyn Van Orden. This file-in provides better user feedback in the Transcript when filing in and filing out code.



"To file it in:"

(FileStream oldFileNamed: 'FileIn-FileOut-changes.st') readOnly; fileIn.

